  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment - IDB, Guarantees, Innovative financing Amazonas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekundering - IDB garantier innovative finansiering Amazonas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seconded consultant to the IDB, the Office of Global Partnerships (GPS) is responsible for establishing and fostering institutional relationships with governments, companies, foundations, universities, non-government organizations. These partnerships leverage IDB expertise, resources, and regional presence, as well as partners&#x2019; financial and non-financial contributions to improve lives in the LAC region.
Within GPS, the Resource Mobilization Division (REM) plays a leading role in mobilizing additional financing for public and private interventions in the IDB Group</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekundering  till IDB, Office of Global Partnerships (GPS) ansvarar f&#xf6;r att etablera och fr&#xe4;mja institutionella relationer med regeringar, f&#xf6;retag, stiftelser, universitet, icke-statliga organisationer. Dessa partnerskap utnyttjar IDB-expertis, resurser och regional n&#xe4;rvaro, s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l som partners finansiella och icke-finansiella bidrag f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra livet i LAC-regionen.
Inom GPS spelar Resource Mobilization Division (REM) en ledande roll i att mobilisera ytterligare finansiering f&#xf6;r offentliga och privata insatser i IDB-gruppen</narrative>
  </description>
